@@ -0,0 +1,68 @@
+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+<meta charset="utf-8">
+<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
+<style>
+  html, body { margin: 0; background: transparent; }
+  body { font-family: sans-serif; color: #fff; padding: 12px 12px 40px; line-height: 1.4; }
+  .logo { position: fixed; top: 50%; left: 50%; width: 70vw; max-width: 320px;
+          transform: translate(-50%, -50%); opacity: .10; border-radius: 22%; z-index: -1; }
+  h1 { font-size: 20px; text-align: center; margin: 4px 0 2px; }
+  .sub { text-align: center; opacity: .85; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
+  section { background: rgba(16, 24, 28, .84); border: 1px solid rgba(77, 208, 200, .45);
+            border-radius: 12px; padding: 4px 14px 10px; margin: 10px 0; }
+  h2 { font-size: 16px; color: #4DD0C8; margin: 10px 0 4px; }
+  ul, ol { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px; }
+  li { margin: 3px 0; }
+  b { color: #fff; }
+</style>
+</head>
+<body>
+<img class="logo" src="{{LOGO}}" alt="">
+<h1>External Cover OS</h1>
+<div class="sub">Your cover screen, with apps, widgets and dictation.</div>
+
+<section>
+<h2>How to activate it</h2>
+<ol>
+  <li>Turn on the <b>switch</b> at the top right of this screen.</li>
+  <li>Grant the <b>permissions</b> in the list: Notifications, Usage access, Ignore battery and Accessibility.</li>
+  <li><b>Close the phone</b> and turn on the cover screen: External Cover OS appears.</li>
+  <li>Tap the bottom button to open the <b>app drawer</b>. A double tap closes the launcher.</li>
+</ol>
+</section>
+
+<section>
+<h2>What you can do</h2>
+<ul>
+  <li><b>Apps on the cover screen:</b> open any of them from the drawer, sorted by most used. Search by name, by hand or by dictating.</li>
+  <li><b>Widgets:</b> each one fills the screen; swipe to switch. Pick them in <i>Widgets</i>.</li>
+  <li><b>Notifications:</b> read and answer them, also by voice.</li>
+  <li><b>Quick toggles:</b> Wi‑Fi, Bluetooth, NFC, sound, Do Not Disturb and flashlight.</li>
+  <li><b>App bar:</b> Back, Home, Recent and rotation lock.</li>
+  <li><b>Resume:</b> if the screen turns off with apps open, a <b>fingerprint</b> button appears when it turns on again. It brings back the last three (it asks for your fingerprint if the phone is locked).</li>
+</ul>
+</section>
+
+<section>
+<h2>Dictation microphone</h2>
+<ul>
+  <li>It appears next to any text field on the cover screen. It needs the <b>Accessibility</b> service.</li>
+  <li><b>Tap</b> to start recording and tap again to stop.</li>
+  <li><b>Swipe</b> over it to switch microphones: <b>green</b> = normal, instant dictation; <b>lilac</b> = dictation with AI (Gemini), which transcribes and cleans the text with punctuation. For the lilac one, enter your key in <i>Dictation with AI</i>.</li>
+  <li>The button next to it <b>deletes</b> letter by letter; hold it to keep deleting.</li>
+</ul>
+</section>
+
+<section>
+<h2>Customization</h2>
+<ul>
+  <li><b>Cover settings:</b> accent color, theme, icon alignment, large icon, vibration and screen timeout.</li>
+  <li><b>Drawer options:</b> grid or list, apps per row, search bar, wallpaper and its blur, icon pack (like Arcticons) and assigning icons to apps that have none.</li>
+  <li><b>Hide / Show apps:</b> choose which apps appear in the drawer.</li>
+  <li>Any problem? Tap <i>Any problems?</i> to send a log.</li>
+</ul>
+</section>
+</body>
+</html>
